WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.010
Risk runs through banks. And most of it never gets a market.

2
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:13.430
Today, hedging means a bank desk. Credit checks. Minimums. Bespoke terms. Most businesses never get in.

3
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:23.290
On Dexetera, anyone can create a market on any number public data measures. Like the Niño 3.4 ocean temperature index.

4
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:30.910
Trade it long or short, in USDC, on a live order book. One signature. No gas.

5
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:43.340
It settles from NOAA's published data, verified by UMA's oracle. No middleman.

6
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:50.040
And whoever creates a market earns a share of the fees on every trade, for as long as it trades.

7
00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:56.280
Any business cost can become a market to hedge.

8
00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:00.220
Dexetera. Hedge the unhedgeable.
